named doctor has always had everything he's ever wanted, but that has only made him develop more extreme and depraved needs. He kidnaps a young couple in the prime of their life together and forces them into a game of torment that slowly extinguishes their hopes for survival.","tagline":"King of Japanese Grotesque Movie"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"和男 は、会社の同僚であるアキに想いを寄せている。そんなデートの最中、二人は突然何者かに襲われ見知らぬ地下室で目を覚ました。手足は拘束され、口には猿ぐつわ。完璧なる監禁、事態を飲み込むことができるハズもなく、ただただ恐怖におびえる二人の前に、医師の免許を持つ謎の男が現れた。「きみたち二人の愛に感動できれば解放するよ」と男は話す…。男は、二人に恥辱の限りを尽くし、そして命の限りの虐待を施す。それも彼らの愛情で感動を得る為だという。その地下室から、完璧なる監禁から彼らは脱出することができるのだろうか…。衝撃の結末が2人の行く末を阻む。","tagline":"君はどこまで地獄を凝視できるだろうか？"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fVo2fe3DuawETejS898DGskT6P2.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2zEOvjgzaUbVkWu2cwEJSyrtvOZ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}},"tmdb:inventory-v2:series":{"originalLanguage":"ja-JP","images":{"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A8PJ82bBBLItWjZOC4owC8eukD7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A8PJ82bBBLItWjZOC4owC8eukD7.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mOO0I9quWW26IpkBSMK4BQHsz5f.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mOO0I9quWW26IpkBSMK4BQHsz5f.jpg","language":"en","width":1560,"height":2340},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fVo2fe3DuawETejS898DGskT6P2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fVo2fe3DuawETejS898DGskT6P2.jpg","language":"ja","width":500,"height":751},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vBPgFJEHoHJqNdYOX3a8d8qMcCb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vBPgFJEHoHJqNdYOX3a8d8qMcCb.jpg","language":"ja","width":780,"height":1170},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AighRuYeVWeDfvtZU5ocbKwGTJZ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AighRuYeVWeDfvtZU5ocbKwGTJ